      "v": 5,
      "zh": "长老中有一位对我说：「不要哭！看哪，犹大支派中的狮子，大卫的根，他已得胜，能以展开那书卷，揭开那七印。」",
      "en": "Then[NOTE:1] one of the elders said[NOTE:2] to me, “Stop weeping![NOTE:3] Look, the Lion of the tribe of Judah, the root of David, has conquered;[NOTE:4] thus he can open[NOTE:5] the scroll and its seven seals.”",
